<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>WHEN I GO</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">PRYVT, BIG Naughty</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">WHEN I GO</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5cfLg7gY79VSGnJKDOO0Zi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.670" end="00:17.682">When I go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.682" end="00:21.538">Will you reminisce the little things?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.538" end="00:28.615">'Bout me, 'bout me, 'bout me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.615" end="00:32.382">I miss you slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.382" end="00:36.647">I pray you won't cry too long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.647" end="00:43.673">I'm here, just waitin' for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.673" end="00:51.218">And if you forget your way to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.218" end="00:58.747">Just follow the autumn breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.747" end="01:01.593">My love won't go fade</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.593" end="01:06.187">Till we meet again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.187" end="01:09.448">And then, only then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.448" end="01:13.770">We'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.770" end="01:20.296">I don't mind, even if you can't remember of your own eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.296" end="01:28.296">You're why my life, is right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.585" end="01:35.362">I don't mind, even if you can't remember of your own eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.362" end="01:43.362">I'm right by your side, your whole life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.169" end="01:47.942">'Cause I don't wanna feel alive and dead in the same night no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.942" end="01:49.950">I just want to feel your love on live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.950" end="01:51.450">when you smile, babe, I'm sure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.294" end="01:53.388">We're out of time for sure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.388" end="01:57.913">And I'm spitting love on shute</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.913" end="02:00.668">Come get your lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.668" end="02:02.731">I mean it we just know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.731" end="02:06.244">Otherwise I'll drown like the sunset on shore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.244" end="02:08.052">Goodbyes are on board</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.052" end="02:12.824">And I'm still on our port</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.824" end="02:19.851">And if you forget your way to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.851" end="02:27.426">Just follow the autumn breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.426" end="02:30.444">My love won't go fade</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.444" end="02:34.963">Till we meet again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.963" end="02:42.249">And then, only then, we'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.249" end="02:48.770">I don't mind, even if you can't remember of your own eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.770" end="02:56.770">You're why my life, is right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.056" end="03:04.086">I don't mind, even if you can't remember of your own eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.086" end="03:08.086">I'm right by your side, your whole life</p></div></body></tt>